# Installation
sudo pacman -S zoxide

On .bashrc after the PATH export, add:

eval "$(zoxide init bash --cmd s)"

Actions                           | Command
----------------------------------|----------------------------------
Add a directory                   | zoxide add ~/plan
List all directories with scores  | zoxide query -ls
List directories only             | zoxide query -l
Remove one                        | zoxide remove ~/plan
Database location (Linux)         | ~/.local/share/zoxide/db.zoxide

# Directories to add

zoxide add ~/plan ~/books ~/dotfiles ~/projects ~/audio
